# CryptValt Deploy — Environment Variables
# Add these in Gitpod → Settings → Variables
# NEVER commit real values to GitHub

# Your CryptValt Founder wallet private key
# Get from MetaMask → Account Details → Export Private Key
# Delete this variable immediately after deployment
PRIVATE_KEY=your_private_key_here

